#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&klinkstatus; is a link checker for &kde;. It allows you to search internal "
"and external links in your entire web site, just a single page and choose "
"the depth to search. You can also check local files, ftp, fish, &etc;, as "
"&klinkstatus; uses KIO. For performance, links can be checked simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"&klinkstatus; is a link checker for &kde;. Dozvoljava vam da pretražite sve "
"unutrašnje i vanjske linkove na cijelom web sajtu, samo jednu stranicu i "
"izaberite koliko da pretražuje. Također možete da provjerite lokalne fajlove,"
"ftp, fish, &etc;, as &klinkstatus; uses KIO. Za preformanse, linke može "
"provjeravati istovremeno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Application capabilities can be extended with <ulink url=\"http://techbase."
"kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Kross/Introduction\">Kross scripting</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Mogućnosti aplikacije mogu biti naddograđene sa <ulink url=\"http://techbase."
"kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Kross/Introduction\">Kross scripting</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &klinkstatus;"
msgstr "Korištenje  &klinkstatus;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To check links on a web site or local file enter its address into the "
"<guilabel>URL:</guilabel> field and hit &Enter;. You can also use folder "
"icon to the right to navigate to the address needed using &GUI;."
msgstr ""
"Da bi provjerili linkove na web sajtu ili u lokalnim fajlovima ukucajte "
"adresu u <guilabel>URL:</guilabel> polje i pritisnitet &Enter;.Također "
"možete koristiti ikonu foldera za navigaciju do potrebne adrese koristeći "
"&GUI;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &klinkstatus;"
msgstr "Ovdje je slika monitora od &klinkstatus;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Slika ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&klinkstatus; is checking links on KDevelop web site. Broken and malformed "
"links are marked with red."
msgstr ""
"&klinkstatus; provjerava linove na KDevelop web sajtu. Pokvareni i "
"deformisani linkovi su ožnaceni crvenom bojom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If access to the inspected data is restricted, please check the "
"<guilabel>Login</guilabel> option. After hitting &Enter; in &URL; field or "
"push <guibutton>Start Search</guibutton> button on the toolbar the following "
"dialog will be shown to enter the credentials."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ulazak u traženu datoteku zabranjen, molimo vas provjerite "
"<guilabel>Login</guilabel> opcije. Nakon pritiskanja  &Enter; in &URL; field "
"or push <guibutton>Počni Pretragu</guibutton> dugme na alatnoj traci "
"odgovarajuči dijalog će se pokazati da uneste dokaz."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Credentials dialog of &klinkstatus;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Credentials dialog of &klinkstatus;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Credentials dialog of &klinkstatus;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Credentials dialog of &klinkstatus;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klinkstatus; is asking you to enter the credentials."
msgstr "&klinkstatus; vam traži da uneste dokaz."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the credentials and push <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Unesite dokaz i pritisnite  <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can narrow down the range of the links to be checked by unchecking "
"<guilabel>Check external links</guilabel> item (if external links need not "
"to be checked) or entering regular expression into <guilabel>Do not check "
"Regular Expression</guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"Možete suziti raspon linkova koje treba provjeriti birajući "
"<guilabel>Provjeri vanjske linkove </guilabel> stvar (ako vanjski link treba "
"biti provjeren) ili regularni izraz ulaska<guilabel> Nemoj provjeravati "
"reguralni izraz</guilabel>polje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Search results can be filtered using <guilabel>Search</guilabel> field or "
"<guilabel>Status</guilabel> drop-down menu (<guimenuitem>All Links</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Good Links</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Broken "
"Links</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Malformed Links</guimenuitem>, or "
"<guimenuitem>Undetermined Links</guimenuitem>)."
msgstr ""
"Pronađeni rezultati mogu biti filtrirani upotrebom <guilabel>Pretraži</"
"guilabel> polje ili  <guilabel>Status</guilabel> drop-down menu "
"(<guimenuitem>All Links</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem> Dobri Linkovi</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Pokvareni Linkovi</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Deformirani Linkovi</guimenuitem>, or <guimenuitem>Nedefonisani "
"Linkovi</guimenuitem>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the context menu of each item in search results you can "
"<guimenuitem>Recheck</guimenuitem> item, <guisubmenu>Edit Referrer</"
"guisubmenu> in the default editor, <guimenuitem>Open URL</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Open Referrer URL</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Copy URL</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Copy Referrer URL</guimenuitem>, or "
"<guimenuitem>Copy Cell Text</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Od kontekstnog izbornik za svaku stavku u rezultatima pretraživanja "
"možete<guimenuitem>Recheck</guimenuitem> item, <guisubmenu>Edit Referrer</"
"guisubmenu> in the default editor, <guimenuitem>Open URL</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Open Referrer URL</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Copy URL</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Copy Referrer URL</guimenuitem>, or "
"<guimenuitem>Copy Cell Text</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The check results can be saved as &XML; site map using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create Site Map...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item, or exported as &HTML; using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Export to HTML</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>. You can choose to export <guimenuitem>All</guimenuitem> or just "
"<guimenuitem>Broken</guimenuitem> links. An option <guimenuitem>Download New "
"Stylesheets</guimenuitem> to use stylesheets from Get Hot New Stuff "
"repository for export is also implemented."
msgstr ""
"Rezultati pretraživanja mogu biti sačuvani kao &XML; koristeći mapu sajta "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Kreiraj Mapu Sajta...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item, ili izvezene kao &HTML; koristeći "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guisubmenu>Izvezi u HTML</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>. Možete izabrati da izveze <guimenuitem>Sve</guimenuitem> ili "
"samo <guimenuitem>pokvarene</guimenuitem>linkove. Opcija "
"<guimenuitem>Preuzmi novi izgled</guimenuitem> koristiti novi izgredod Get "
"Hot New Stuff skladište za izvoz također se provodi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &klinkstatus;"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &klinkstatus;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configuration options of &klinkstatus; can be accessed by opening the "
"configuration dialog with selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &klinkstatus;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Opcije konfiguracije  &klinkstatus; može im se pristupiti otvaranjem "
"konfiguracijskog dijaloga selekcijom  <menuchoice> <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguracija&klinkstatus;...</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> iz izbornika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:159 index.docbook:182 index.docbook:196 index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure &klinkstatus; Dialog"
msgstr "Konfiguracija  &klinkstatus;Dijalog"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Provjerite"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Check</guilabel> page, you can change the default check "
"parameters. This page is divided into three panes (<guilabel>Network</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Input</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Quanta</guilabel>) with "
"additional checkbox <guilabel>Remember settings when exit</guilabel>. If the "
"latter is checked, &klinkstatus; remember configured settings when you exit "
"&klinkstatus; and restore them during the next application run."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel>Provjera</guilabel>stranici, možete promijeniti zadane kontrolne "
"parametre. Ova stranica je podijeljena na tri prozora (<guilabel>Mreža</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Input</guilabel>, i <guilabel>Quanta</guilabel>) sa "
"dodatnom kutijom  <guilabel>Zapamtite postavke kad iziđete</guilabel>. Ako "
"je slovo provjereno &klinkstatus; zapamtite postavke konfiguracije kad "
"iziđete &klinkstatus; i vratite ih prilikom slijedcećg zahtijeva."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Network</guilabel> pane can be used to choose the "
"<guilabel>Number of simultaneous connections</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Timeout in seconds</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"The <guilabel>Mreža</guilabel>prozor se može koristiti da se izabere "
"<guilabel>Broj istovremenih konekcija</guilabel> i<guilabel>Pauze u "
"sekundama</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the <guilabel>Number of items in &URL; history</guilabel> "
"(default is 50) and the <guilabel>Depth</guilabel> of check (can be "
"overriden with &klinkstatus; main window, 0 for <guilabel>Unlimited</"
"guilabel>). You can also decide if &klinkstatus; should <guilabel>Check "
"parent folders</guilabel> and <guilabel>Check external links</guilabel> (can "
"be overriden with &klinkstatus; main window)."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti <guilabel>Broj stavki u  &URL; historiji</guilabel> "
"(postavljeno je 50) i <guilabel>Dubinu </guilabel> pregleda (može premašiti "
"sa &klinkstatus; main window, 0 for <guilabel>Unlimited</guilabel>).Možete "
"također odlučiti &klinkstatus; treba <guilabel>Provjeriti matični folder</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Provjeriti vanske linkove</guilabel> (može se "
"premostiti sa &klinkstatus; glavni prozor)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Quanta</guilabel> pane is used to control &quantaplus; "
"integration of &klinkstatus;. Check <guilabel>Use preview prefix</guilabel> "
"if you want to use &quantaplus;'s project preview prefix in the &URL; to "
"check."
msgstr ""
"The <guilabel>Quanta</guilabel>ploča se koristi za kontrolu &quantaplus;"
"integraciju &klinkstatus;. Provjera <guilabel>Koristite pregled prefiksa</"
"guilabel> ako želite koristiti &quantaplus;'s plan pregleda prefiksa the "
"&URL; provjera."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Results"
msgstr "Rezultati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Results</guilabel> page you can choose format of the "
"check results list. <guilabel>Tree</guilabel> is the default tree view and "
"<guilabel>Flat</guilabel> is the flat list (can be faster on low-end "
"machines). You can also let &klinkstatus; <guilabel>Follow Last Link "
"Checked</guilabel> and define <guilabel>Preferred Style Sheet</guilabel> for "
"the check list. The new stylesheets can be downloaded from the Get Hot New "
"Stuff repository using <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Export to HTML</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Download New "
"Stylesheets</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći<guilabel>Rezultati</guilabel>stranica može izabrati format propisa "
"za provjeru rezultata. <guilabel>Stablo </guilabel> zadani prikaz stabla i "
"<guilabel>Ravan</guilabel> je ravna lista (može biti brži na spori-kraj "
"strojevima). Možete također pustiti &klinkstatus; <guilabel>Partiti Zadnju "
"Provjeru Liste</guilabel> i definisati <guilabel>Željeni Stil Stranice</"
"guilabel> za listu provjere. Novi željeni stil stranice se može skinuti sa "
"Get Hot New Stuff repozitorij korištenja <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Izvezi u  HTML</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Skini Novi Željeni Stil "
"Stranice</guimenuitem></menuchoice> stavka izbornika."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Identification"
msgstr "Identifikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Identification</guilabel> page you can configure the way "
"&klinkstatus; reports itself to the server that stores the page checked. You "
"can choose to <guilabel>Send Identification</guilabel>. Use "
"<guibutton>Default</guibutton> button to set the default identification of "
"&konqueror;. <guilabel>Identity</guilabel> pane can be used to choose your "
"identity for authentication on the server."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći<guilabel> Identifikacija</guilabel> možete konfigurisati "
"način&klinkstatus;  da se prijavi sam na server koji sačuva provjeren "
"stranice. Možete birati  <guilabel> Posalji Identifikaciju </guilabel>. "
"Koristi<guibutton> Default </guibutton>dugme za defult "
"identifikacije&konqueror;.<guilabel> Identitet</guilabel>  prozor se može "
"koristiti za biranje identiteta autentifikacije na serveru."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mail Transport"
msgstr "Mail Transport"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Mail Transport</guilabel> page, you can configure email "
"account which receives &klinkstatus; scheduled check results."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći <guilabel>Mail Transport</guilabel> stranice, možete konfigurisati "
"email račun koji prima &klinkstatus; planiran pregled razultat."

